ttacks were successful, resulting in an Attack Presentation Classification Error Rate (APCER) of\expnd-7\expndtw-36  \f0\fs24\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 0%.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb4\f0\fs23\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li220\ri339\qj\sl240\slmult1\sb1\f0\fs24\b0 As a uniquely accredited third-party biometrics testing lab, iBeta Quality Assurance ensures that products meet the highest standards of functionality and security. The iBeta certification guarantees the most precise liveness and anti-spoofing checks for images and videos.\par\sect\sectd\sbkpage\headery0\footery994\margtsxn1340\margbsxn1200\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li220\sl240\slmult1\sb71\f0\fs24\b0 Sample projects are available in \f9\fs24\b0\i0 samples\'5Cibeta liveness add-on \f0\fs24\b0\i0 directory.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb2\f0\fs31\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s3\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li220\sl240\slmult1{\*\bkmkstart Activation}{\*\bkmkend Activation}{\*\bkmkstart _bookmark144}{\*\bkmkend _bookmark144}\f7\fs32\b1 Activation\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li220\ri325\sl242\slmult1\sb120\f0\fs24\b0 iBeta liveness add-on requires a license key, which should be installed on the target Windows, or Linux system before starting your application.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb8\f0\fs23\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li220\ri502\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs24\b0 If the key is not present you will be unable to use the iBeta add-on. The license key is a file with the .v2c extension, you can find it in the sample's license directory. To install it, run the install_license utility that is bundled along with the key: \f1\fs24\b1\i0 install_license *.v2c\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb6\f1\fs31\b1\i0\par\pard\plain\s3\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li220\sl240\slmult1{\*\bkmkstart Initialization}{\*\bkmkend Initialization}{\*\bkmkstart _bookmark145}{\*\bkmkend _bookmark145}\f7\fs32\b1 Initialization\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li220\sl-275\sb120\f0\fs24\b0 To initialize the iBeta add-on you should call the following function:\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li220\sl-270\f9\fs24\b0 int res = FSDK_SetParameter("LivenessModel", "external");\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li220\ri4492\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs24\b0 The returned value should be equal to \f9\fs24\b0\i0 FSDKE_OK\f0 . Possible returned error codes:\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb1\f0\fs24\b0\i0\par
